prompts.raw:
Group name: {{groupName}}
Members: {{memberCount}}
Last active: {{lastMessageAt}}
Currently active: {{active}}

Is this WhatsApp group a life chapter?

A life chapter = a distinct period defined by shared context: university cohort, city you lived in, a job era, travel, a close crew from a specific time.
NOT a chapter = family groups, large work announcement channels, generic unnamed groups, logistics groups.

Respond ONLY with valid JSON, no other text:
{
  "isChapter": boolean,
  "chapterName": string,
  "startYear": number | null,
  "endYear": number | null,
  "confidence": number,
  "reason": string
}

